{"id": "c15", "kind": "doc", "text": "모든 파일이 frontmatter 에 depends_on 과 referenced_by 를 적어 양방향 의존 그래프를 이룬다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 고정 사본(2026-10-07 수신) 기준 §Building the Organizational Second Brain", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Building the Organizational Second Brain", "quote": "Every file declares its dependencies (depends_on) and consumers (referenced_by) in YAML frontmatter, forming a bidirectional dependency graph."}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Building the Organizational Second Brain", "quote": "When one file changes, you can trace exactly what else might be affected, which matters when the self-improvement loop proposes automated edits."}]}
{"id": "c16", "kind": "doc", "text": "routing index 는 입력의 특징을 해당 position 과 절차에 잇고 embedding 유사도에만 기대지 않는다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 고정 사본(2026-10-07 수신) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Building the Organizational Second Brain", "quote": "Routing indexes map input characteristics to the relevant positions and procedures, determining which files apply without relying on embedding similarity alone. This makes retrieval deterministic and auditable."}]}
